OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FThe word adoption has played a big
OL,7,Fpart in my life.
OL,9,FIt is a word that has always meant a
OL,10,Flot to me, but also something that I
OL,11,Fhave wanted to find out more about.
OL,13,FSo, to confront my past and to mark
OL,14,Fthe centenary year of adoption being
OL,15,Flegalised in Britain, I set out on a
OL,16,Fjourney to learn all about it.
OL,18,FLike every story, I wanted to start at
OL,19,Fthe beginning.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/12
