OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FI was born in Russia in 1996. From my
OL,7,Funderstanding, my birth mother was
OL,8,Fyoung and the decision was made to put
OL,9,Fme in an orphanage just outside of St
OL,10,FPetersburg. My parents, Robert and
OL,11,FGillian, visited the orphanage four
OL,12,Fmonths later.
OL,14,FI turned over in my cot and gave them
OL,15,Fa smile. The decision was made. They
OL,16,Fadopted me in May 1997 and brought me
OL,17,Fback to London, when my new life began.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
