OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FMy parents have given me a wonderful
OL,7,Flife but as any adopted person will
OL,8,Fknow, you always have questions about
OL,9,Fhow and why you came into the world.
OL,11,FPerhaps one day, I will get those
OL,12,Fanswers.
OL,14,FThe history
OL,16,FAs a reporter based in Plymouth, you
OL,17,Fcan understand my surprise when
OL,18,Fhistorian Vanessa Nolan told me one of
OL,19,Fthe real pioneers of adoption was down
OL,20,Fthe road from me in Exeter.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
