OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FBorn in 1862, Clara Andrew worked with
OL,7,Forphans and refugees in the city
OL,8,Fduring the First World War. It
OL,9,Finspired her to help children and she
OL,10,Fmuscled her way into politics in the
OL,11,F1920s to encourage the legalisation of
OL,12,Fadoption.
OL,14,FOn 4 August 1926, the Adoption Act was
OL,15,Fpassed.
OL,17,FIt might have started with the best of
OL,18,Fintentions, but in the decades that
OL,19,Ffollowed, pain and suffering was
OL,20,Finflicted on countless women.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
