OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FBetween 1949 and 1976, up to a quarter
OL,7,Fof a million women were forced or
OL,8,Fcoerced into giving up their babies
OL,9,Fsimply because they were unmarried.
OL,11,FSpeaking to Lyn Rodden, I was shocked
OL,12,Fto hear the true extent of the
OL,13,Ftreatment of women in state or church-
OL,14,Frun institutions. In 1956, at seven
OL,15,Fmonths pregnant, Lyn was sent to
OL,16,FRosemundy Mother and Baby Home in
OL,17,FCornwall.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
