CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FLyn described the cruelty she faced,
OL,7,Fhaving to scrubs the floors pregnant
OL,8,Fand being locked in her room while
OL,9,Fprospective parents came to look at
OL,10,Fthe babies.
OL,12,FThere was also unimaginable racism at
OL,13,Fthe time. For Phil Frampton, who was a
OL,14,Fmixed raced baby born at Rosemundy,
OL,15,Fhis notes deemed he was unadoptable
OL,16,Fbecause of his race. Phil grew up in
OL,17,Forphanages and children's homes.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
