OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FIn 2026, apologies came from the
OL,7,FGovernment and the Church of England
OL,8,Ffor their involvement in systemic
OL,9,Ffailures. The Catholic Church
OL,10,Fapologised in 2016.
OL,12,FLessons have been learnt since the
OL,13,Fforced adoption period, but different
OL,14,Fchallenges present themselves today.
OL,16,FPressures facing modern system
OL,18,FThroughout making this documentary I
OL,19,Fhave met and interviewed such an
OL,20,Finspiring group of people.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
