PN,40208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FFrom speaking to social workers, Steve
OL,7,FDarling MP and Dame Carol Homden, the
OL,8,FChief Executive of the charity Coram,
OL,9,Fit is clear the system today is under
OL,10,Fimmense pressure.
OL,12,FChildren today have far more complex
OL,13,Fneeds, coming from homes where they
OL,14,Fmay have been drug or alcohol misuse.
OL,15,FThis means adoptive parents are
OL,16,Fneeding greater support.
OL,18,FBut at the same time, there are simply
OL,19,Fnot enough people coming forward to
OL,20,Fadopt for the increasing number of
OL,21,Fchildren entering the care system.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FPerhaps people are concerned they
OL,7,Fmight not be able to fulfil the needs
OL,8,Fof a child.
OL,10,FBut as social worker Julia Neilson
OL,11,Fmade it clear to me, there is no shame
OL,12,Fto ask for help if you adopt. In fact,
OL,13,Fit should be a given.
OL,15,FOne mother bravely told me why she
OL,16,Ffelt she had no choice but to put her
OL,17,Fbaby up for adoption.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
