PN,40210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FDuring our interview, 'Sophia'
OL,7,Fexplained how she wanted to give her
OL,8,Fson a better life, considering what
OL,9,Fshe could provide for him at the time.
OL,11,FI was incredibly moved by her strength
OL,12,Fand kindness shown to her son's
OL,13,Fadoptive parents.
OL,15,FOver the decades, as the world as
OL,16,Fopened up, so too has international
OL,17,Fadoptions.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
