PN,40211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FCoram trustee and researcher Zoe
OL,7,FLambert eloquently explained how
OL,8,Ftransracial adoptive families have to
OL,9,Fwork that bit harder to understand and
OL,10,Flearn from each other.
OL,12,FWhether that is around the
OL,13,Fpracticalities of hair and skin care,
OL,14,Fto much deeper conversations
OL,15,Fappreciating each other's backgrounds
OL,16,Fand cultural differences.
OL,18,FI often describe life as a beautiful
OL,19,Fjigsaw puzzle and if you are adopted,
OL,20,Fyou may always have a piece or two
OL,21,Fmissing in your story.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
