FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786112311
OL,3,CHow being adopted from Russia in 1997
OL,4,Chas changed my life
OL,6,FIt has been truly wonderful to make
OL,7,Fthese connections and discuss at
OL,8,Flength, adoption and identity, what is
OL,9,Fmeans to find out the answers to long-
OL,10,Fawaited questions and if closure is
OL,11,Fever really possible.
OL,13,FYes, the are problems within the
OL,14,Fmodern system and memories of the past
OL,15,Fare still very much alive for some.
OL,17,FBut it is clear that there are a lot
OL,18,Fof good people out there, just wanting
OL,19,Fto help children and make their
OL,20,Ffutures better.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
